{"text": "El león sacó una pata, luego otra, y salió de la red. Dio las gracias al ratón. Ahora entendía que un cuerpo grande no sirve para todas las tareas y que el pequeño tenía habilidades muy valiosas. León: Tus dientes hicieron lo que mi fuerza no podía.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.315833, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.330583, "end": 0.611166, "from": 3, "to": 7}, {"start": 0.625958, "end": 0.965624, "from": 8, "to": 12}, {"start": 0.980416, "end": 1.246249, "from": 13, "to": 16}, {"start": 1.261, "end": 1.6745, "from": 17, "to": 21}, {"start": 2.04375, "end": 2.398208, "from": 23, "to": 28}, {"start": 2.412958, "end": 2.855999, "from": 29, "to": 33}, {"start": 3.151375, "end": 3.225208, "from": 35, "to": 36}, {"start": 3.24, "end": 3.6535, "from": 37, "to": 42}, {"start": 3.66825, "end": 3.801166, "from": 43, "to": 45}, {"start": 3.815958, "end": 3.934124, "from": 46, "to": 48}, {"start": 3.948875, "end": 4.347625, "from": 49, "to": 52}, {"start": 5.390458, "end": 5.656291, "from": 54, "to": 57}, {"start": 5.671083, "end": 5.892624, "from": 58, "to": 61}, {"start": 5.907375, "end": 6.4095, "from": 62, "to": 69}, {"start": 6.42425, "end": 6.542416, "from": 70, "to": 72}, {"start": 6.557166, "end": 7.103582, "from": 73, "to": 78}, {"start": 8.137416, "end": 8.477082, "from": 80, "to": 85}, {"start": 8.491833, "end": 9.097333, "from": 86, "to": 94}, {"start": 9.112125, "end": 9.274583, "from": 95, "to": 98}, {"start": 9.289333, "end": 9.436999, "from": 99, "to": 101}, {"start": 9.451791, "end": 9.865291, "from": 102, "to": 108}, {"start": 9.880083, "end": 10.278833, "from": 109, "to": 115}, {"start": 10.293583, "end": 10.470791, "from": 116, "to": 118}, {"start": 10.485583, "end": 10.913874, "from": 119, "to": 124}, {"start": 10.928625, "end": 11.194458, "from": 125, "to": 129}, {"start": 11.20925, "end": 11.652291, "from": 130, "to": 135}, {"start": 11.667041, "end": 11.829499, "from": 136, "to": 139}, {"start": 11.844291, "end": 12.390707, "from